# windows contest tools

# Windows contest tools (day1/002 EKS)

`.\start.cmd` apply for EKS assignments requires binaries on PATH:

- AWS CLI v2 (`aws.exe`)
- `kubectl.exe`
- Docker Desktop (`docker.exe`) + daemon running
- Git for Windows (`bash.exe`) — Terraform `local-exec` uses `bash -c`, not `/bin/bash`

`build/ensure-contest-tools.ps1` is called from `start.ps1` before apply. It prepends common install dirs to PATH and fails early if tools are missing.

Do not hard-code `interpreter = ["/bin/bash", "-c"]` in assignment Terraform; use `local.local_exec_interpreter` (or `["bash", "-c"]` on Windows).
